  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopia DRA Acute Mechanism Joint Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Around 7.2 million people in Ethiopia are severely food insecure due to the drought.&amp;nbsp;Borena with predominantly pastoralist livelihoods is among the severely drought hit Zone in Oromia with almost 50% of the population in need of immediate food assistance. TdH NL/SND will provide MPC &amp;amp; Livelihood protection (livestock feeds) to the most vulnerable &amp;amp; at-risk families focusing on HHs with malnourished children &amp;amp; those facing protection risks to meet their immediate food &amp;amp; protection needs.</narrative>
  </description>
